{"id":"b6e54519dc883f49","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-net.md","title":"Net","display":"df-net — Net","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-net","aliases":["58-df-net"],"display":"df-net — Net","depends_on":["[[58-df-directed-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-net"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-net</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-net — Net"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e61c089fc5e610a6\" href=\"?note=e61c089fc5e610a6\" title=\"58-df-directed-set\">58-df-directed-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,X,x,\\leq_I\\in V\">\\(I,X,x,\\leq_I\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Net}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Net}_S\\)</span> (defined here; net predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Directed}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Directed}_S\\)</span> (directed-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e61c089fc5e610a6\" href=\"?note=e61c089fc5e610a6\" title=\"58-df-directed-set\">58-df-directed-set</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}net} \\vdash \\mathrm{Net}_S(x,I,\\leq_I,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Directed}_S(I,\\leq_I)\\land x\\in X^I\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}net} \\vdash \\mathrm{Net}_S(x,I,\\leq_I,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Directed}_S(I,\\leq_I)\\land x\\in X^I\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Nets generalize sequences by directed-set indexing.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-directed-set","status":"resolved","id":"e61c089fc5e610a6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-directed-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-directed-set","status":"resolved","id":"e61c089fc5e610a6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Directed}_S$ (directed-set predicate, see [[58-df-directed-set]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I,X,x,\\leq_I\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Net}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Directed}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}net} \\vdash \\mathrm{Net}_S(x,I,\\leq_I,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Directed}_S(I,\\leq_I)\\land x\\in X^I","display":true}],"bytes":562,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-875","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-net.md|58-df-net]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["e61c089fc5e610a6"]}